(b) shipping and navigation on the River Niger and its affluents
and on any such other inland waterway as may be designated
by the National Assembly to be an international waterway or
to be an inter-State waterway;
(c) lighthouses, lightships, beacons and other
provisions for the safety of shipping and navigation;

(d) such ports as may be declared by the National Assembly to
